---
import LegalPage from '../../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../consts';
---

<LegalPage
  locale="en"
  altHref="/datenschutz"
  title="Privacy"
  lead="What happens when you visit this site, and what does not."
>
  <h2>What this site processes</h2>
  <p>
    The site is static and loads nothing from third parties. Fonts are served
    from this domain, there is no analytics, no embeds and no cookies. Your
    choice of light or dark appearance is stored locally in your browser and
    never transmitted.
  </p>

  <h2>Server logs</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served through GitHub Pages. For technical reasons the provider
    records access data. Those details will be added here.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of
    processing, data portability and objection, as well as the right to lodge a
    complaint with a supervisory authority. To exercise them, write to
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>Schedi Samet, reachable at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
